%% Enroll-Credential (CAAPI)
%% Mint a new proof-of-possession credential. The Credential Authority
%% is the RATS Relying Party; the CAS Server forwards and does not appraise.
sequenceDiagram
    participant CAI as CAI
    participant CAS_C as CAS<br/>Client
    participant CAS_S as CAS<br/>Server
    participant V as Verifier
    participant CA as Credential<br/>Authority

    autonumber

    note over CAI, CAS_C: CAAPI
    CAI->>CAS_C: Enroll-Credential<br/>(Target, Credential Type, Credential Hint,<br/>Evidence, CSR, Signing Algorithm)
    note over CAS_C, CAS_S: CAS Protocol
    CAS_C->>CAS_S: Enroll-Credential<br/>(Target, Credential Type, Credential Hint,<br/>Evidence, CSR, Signing Algorithm)
    note over CAS_S, V: Passport model (Background Check<br/>is equivalent from the Attester's view)
    CAS_S->>V: Appraise Evidence
    V->>V: Check Evidence, report the<br/>TACRA Binding digest (freshness input)<br/>in Attestation Results
    V-->>CAS_S: Attestation Results
    note over CAS_S, CA: Credential Authority is the RATS RP
    CAS_S->>CA: Enroll<br/>(Attestation Results, Target, CSR,<br/>Credential Hint)
    CA->>CA: Validate Attestation Results
    CA->>CA: Recompute TACRA Binding over<br/>freshness, Target, and CSR
    CA->>CA: Mint credential from CSR,<br/>Attestation Results, Credential Hint
    CA-->>CAS_S: Newly minted credential
    CAS_S-->>CAS_C: Plaintext enrolled credential
    CAS_C-->>CAI: Plaintext enrolled credential
